WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.520
This show contains scenes that some viewers may 
find disturbing. Viewer discretion is advised.

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:02.610
<i>Hi there, it's me, Arc.</i>

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:10.560
<i>After infiltrating the base of some 
elf hunters in the village of Diento,</i>

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:12.330
<b>D
i
m
e
n
s
i
o
n

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:12.940
<i>along with Lady Ariane and Danka,</i>

00:00:13.460 --> 00:00:19.320
<i>I happened upon some information from a 
furry-eared ninja about other kidnapped elves.</i>

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:22.660
<i>A furry-eared ninja! Here we go!</i>

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:26.510
<i>After saving the captive 
elves in the hideout,</i>

00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:30.420
<i>two of us headed to free the elves 
being held at the lord of Diento's palace.</i>

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:36.000
<i>Lady Ariane and I ended up 
having to tackle this task alone.</i>

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:19.620
If you're going to do it, 
then get it over with,

00:02:19.620 --> 00:02:21.620
you flea-dicked bastard!

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:26.560
You always have the most unique reactions.

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:29.950
And those eyes that look at me like I'm trash...

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:32.150
They give me the chills!

00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:38.040
Udolan, my boy...

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:42.070
You accompanied the elf hunters 
without permission and failed...

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:45.170
And then you had the nerve 
to come back alone?

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:51.400
Don't you know how to handle 
these elves, you stupid little boy?

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:56.520
Pay attention, and I'll show you.

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:57.710
No!

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:05.320
This is how you handle an elf.

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:15.540
Arc, let's make our way inside 
from this bell tower.

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:18.880
The lord's chambers are bound 
to be higher in the palace.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:21.340
How can you be sure?

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:24.920
There's an old saying.

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:27.930
Idiots and smoke like high places.

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:31.400
I'm convinced. Let us move quickly, then.

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:35.410
Where did you come from?!

00:03:35.410 --> 00:03:36.430
Whoa there!

00:03:36.430 --> 00:03:38.010
Come along quietly!

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:39.950
Do you realize where you are?!

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.860
We've already been discovered!

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:47.120
Wyvern Slash!

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:47.580
<b>W
y
v
e
r
n

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:55.510
So much for sneaking in!

00:04:00.930 --> 00:04:01.720
Did you see them?!

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:04.210
No, no sign this way.

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:05.960
Where could they have gone?!

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:07.280
Split up and find them!

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:12.890
They're gone.

00:04:13.110 --> 00:04:17.120
We managed to weather the trouble
despite the commotion.

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:20.000
There's not much else 
we can do. Let's hurry.

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:28.120
Now what...?

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:30.660
Master Tryton! Master Tryton!

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:33.830
What are you shouting about?

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:35.550
I-Intruders!

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:37.170
Intruders have breached the palace!

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:38.680
And?

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:41.920
Why haven't you lot dealt with it already?

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:45.050
B-But sir, they're monsters!

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:49.260
What now?!

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:53.030
Wh-Who are you two?

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:57.110
Good evening. I'm Arc.

00:04:57.110 --> 00:04:59.030
Hope you don't mind us dropping in so late.

00:04:59.350 --> 00:05:01.190
We're here to save you.

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:04.150
It's them!

00:05:04.980 --> 00:05:06.360
Miss Ariane!

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:09.810
Why?! How are they here?!

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:13.020
Rude filth!

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:14.790
Who in the bloody hell do you think—

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:22.880
You two can rest easy now.

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:25.160
Th-Thank you...

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:27.000
You really did come!

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:36.960
You're not going anywhere.

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:45.160
A hidden room?

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:48.480
Well, what do we have here?

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:50.280
Lady Ariane!

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:51.600
Come look at—

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:51.600
Dirty!

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:53.160
Rotten! Bastard!

00:05:54.140 --> 00:05:55.160
You need something?

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:58.120
Uh, no. Don't mind me.

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.400
You wretches!

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:02.700
Don't think you'll get away with this!

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:05.510
I'm a Rhoden Kingdom marquis!

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:06.440
Stop talking.

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:11.920
Lady Ariane, isn't that 
taking things a bit... far?

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:15.620
They broke the treaty first.

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:21.140
I hardly see a problem 
in exacting a price for that.

00:06:26.140 --> 00:06:28.820
You can do what you want with him.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:30.510
Get satisfaction.

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:43.560
Lord Tryton! Are you all right?!

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:45.120
Capture the intruders!

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:48.240
Lady Ariane, keep them occupied!

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:50.530
I have matters to attend 
to in this hidden room!

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:55.300
Resist and you'll get no mercy!

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:59.520
Fire, I implore you. 
Light this sword ablaze!

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:11.240
Miss Ariane!

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:14.540
The two of you need to escape 
and meet up with Danka.

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:16.610
Head for Lalatoya.

00:07:16.610 --> 00:07:17.720
Right!

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:23.620
This is quite the haul!

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:25.670
"Arc got a gold bar!"

00:07:26.140 --> 00:07:27.210
Arc.

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:29.880
I'm finished on this end.

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:31.860
What are you doing?

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:34.120
Lady Ariane...

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:38.650
You'd be surprised how much of it 
is necessary to rebuild an organization.

00:07:38.650 --> 00:07:39.890
"Money", that is.

00:07:40.490 --> 00:07:42.500
What are you talking about?

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:44.190
Think for a moment.

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:51.410
Suppose they tried to re-establish 
their abduction syndicate,

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:54.400
but we'd deprived them of their funds?

00:07:55.670 --> 00:07:57.430
Without the money...

00:07:57.430 --> 00:07:59.880
they wouldn't be able to 
do anything anytime soon.

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:03.070
Well done, Arc.

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:05.590
<i>Yes! She bought it!</i>

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:12.990
Lady Ariane, these explosions...

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:14.860
Did you set a fire?

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:16.350
It wasn't me.

00:08:16.830 --> 00:08:19.360
We're the only ones who came to the castle,

00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:22.710
and Danka should be 
escorting the other elves...

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:26.320
Well, we should make 
ourselves scarce either way.

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:43.660
If it wasn't Lady Ariane, then these 
explosions must've been caused by...

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:47.060
<i>the furry-eared ninja, perhaps.</i>

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:52.800
And thus, I assume 
I've fulfilled my contract.

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:55.680
Yes. And I'm truly grateful.

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:00.790
Is this a sufficient reward?

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:06.930
Although it's not much compared 
to the hidden stores you made off with...

00:09:08.720 --> 00:09:09.720
Many thanks.

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:11.970
Tell me, Arc.

00:09:11.970 --> 00:09:14.350
What are you going to do now?

00:09:14.350 --> 00:09:16.950
I didn't have anything 
in particular in mind.

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:19.200
In that case...

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:21.990
would you like to visit 
the elf lands with me?

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:23.980
The elf lands?

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:25.880
It's not just this place.

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:28.040
Many of my kin are still being held captive.

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:32.000
I'd like it if you continued helping me.

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:36.480
<i>The land of elves!</i>

00:09:36.480 --> 00:09:38.910
<i>Now that sounds fantasy as hell!</i>

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:42.040
<i>I wanna go! I wanna go right now!</i>

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:45.080
But...

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:48.270
would they be willing 
to welcome an outsider like myself?

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:53.240
We'll need to meet with the elder 
and get his permission...

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:57.700
<i>I figured we'd have to meet with the brass.</i>

00:09:58.040 --> 00:10:01.620
And we must meet this elder, no matter what?

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:05.580
Are you worried? 
to prove that I trust you,

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:11.240
I'll introduce you to one of the elders...
To the person that I trust the most.

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:15.120
Lady Ariane...

00:10:16.480 --> 00:10:19.460
I can never remove my armor.

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:26.390
You'd have to at least show your face 
when meeting the elder.

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:31.590
Is there a reason?

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:35.320
There's a chance that you may

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:39.610
turn your sword against me 
the moment I remove this helmet.

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:47.250
And if I swear not to, 
will you show me your face?

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:56.010
<i>At first, I just wanted to help out 
this earnest-looking elf girl, but...</i>

00:10:57.020 --> 00:10:58.910
<i>Traveling with her?</i>

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:01.960
<i>Very well.</i>

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:08.720
Arc...

00:11:08.720 --> 00:11:11.200
What... happened to you?

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:18.180
I'm not sure myself.

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:21.680
I simply found myself in these lands,

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:23.930
with nothing but my altered appearance.

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:26.850
I imagine it must be some kind of curse.

00:11:27.570 --> 00:11:28.830
<i>Even if I told her</i>

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:32.550
<i>"I woke up in another world looking 
like my video game character"</i>

00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:35.050
<i>I doubt she'd understand.</i>

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:40.410
If you were truly undead, 
you'd have the corruption of death...

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:45.760
And you wouldn't be able to use healing spells 
or the power of light to dispel curses.

00:11:47.530 --> 00:11:51.470
And there's no way a spirit creature 
would be this attached to you.

00:11:53.140 --> 00:12:00.690
Arc, you've lent me your strength  
to save my comrades.

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:02.290
Which is why...

00:12:02.290 --> 00:12:07.350
Your secret will be safe among the elves.

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:11.990
If your appearance 
is the result of some curse,

00:12:11.990 --> 00:12:16.000
the elder may have the knowledge to help.

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:18.700
That would be wonderful.

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:24.680
There's nothing I want more than 
to be rid of the curse that affects me.

00:12:25.780 --> 00:12:26.960
Then it's decided.

00:12:32.030 --> 00:12:33.640
Let me make this official.

00:12:34.320 --> 00:12:37.770
I am Ariane Glenys Maple,

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:40.690
a warrior from Maple 
in the Great Canada Forest.

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:43.970
I am Arc.

00:12:43.970 --> 00:12:46.440
I travel to break the curse upon me.

00:12:51.430 --> 00:12:53.400
I'll be at your disposal.

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:59.500
<i>I never thought I'd end up on a journey to</i>

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:03.720
<i>break the curse that I made up 
as part of my character's background...</i>

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:10.820
<i>It's still late at night, 
with only the moon to show the way...</i>

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:17.460
<i>But the path set out for me is clear.</i>

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:24.990
Episode 5

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:24.990
A Secret Revealed, and a Bond Forged

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:31.160
m 0 0 l 248 0 l 248 30 l 0 30

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:31.160
Olav, Capital of the Rhoden Kingdom

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:35.700
King
Karlon Delfriet Rhoden Olav

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:34.080
Regarding the matter of Marquis Diento...

00:13:34.490 --> 00:13:37.130
Do we know who was responsible?

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:40.120
No, Father. Not yet.

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:41.620
First Prince
Sekt Rondahl Karlon Rhoden Sahdiay

00:13:40.120 --> 00:13:45.180
There are rumors that the elves 
are responsible, however.

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:48.220
Second Prince
Dakares Ciciay Karlon Rhoden Vetran

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:54.010
What makes you deem this 
hearsay worth mentioning, Sekt?

00:13:54.940 --> 00:13:57.470
"Marquis Diento was 
in violation of the treaty,

00:13:57.470 --> 00:14:01.830
capturing elves and selling them 
to the eastern empire."

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:05.150
Given this previous rumor, it makes sense.

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:07.860
Second Princess
Yuriarna Merol Melissa Rhoden Olav

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:07.870
The marquis? It can't be...

00:14:08.270 --> 00:14:10.740
Those sound like baseless rumors to me.

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:13.560
Or do you have any proof, Brother Sekt?

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:15.080
What's this?

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:18.790
Are you standing up 
for Marquis Diento, Dakares?

00:14:20.100 --> 00:14:25.000
I am telling you not to impugn the nobility 
of this kingdom with mere rumors!

00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:26.960
Calm yourselves.

00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:31.440
Dakares is correct.

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:35.440
Do not condemn the marquis 
without sufficient cause.

00:14:35.440 --> 00:14:40.140
But the fact is, these rumors 
do bear further investigation.

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:41.600
Sire.

00:14:43.830 --> 00:14:48.570
We should inquire into what's 
happened in Diento immediately.

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:52.830
What is your take on this matter, Yuriarna?

00:14:53.470 --> 00:14:56.330
I had heard these rumors as well.

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:57.850
And if they are true,

00:14:57.850 --> 00:15:01.540
it would not only mean breaking 
our treaty with the elves,

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:05.920
but it could raise tensions between 
our kingdom and the other nations.

00:15:06.640 --> 00:15:09.230
We should ascertain the truth quickly

00:15:09.230 --> 00:15:12.800
and arrange to speak with the elves.

00:15:13.360 --> 00:15:19.470
If the elves were to seek retribution 
by halting their arrangements with Limbult...

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:25.420
We would be held responsible 
by the other countries.

00:15:25.420 --> 00:15:26.740
Yes.

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:32.090
The magical equipment would be bad enough,

00:15:32.090 --> 00:15:36.740
but if they were to withhold the rune 
stones needed for crop cultivation...

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:40.520
We'd be courting uprisings 
from our own nobility as well.

00:15:41.050 --> 00:15:42.400
Yuriarna,

00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:48.510
head to Limbult and make arrangements 
so that we might speak with the elves.

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:51.120
As you wish, Father.

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:55.980
That will be all for today.

00:16:09.790 --> 00:16:11.160
Good grief.

00:16:11.890 --> 00:16:13.900
This has become quite a mess...

00:16:21.590 --> 00:16:23.320
Such dense woods.

00:16:23.320 --> 00:16:25.120
We hardly seem to be making any headway.

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:29.240
Yes. But once we're through here...

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:31.080
<i>There we go!</i>

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:33.200
<i>There's better visibility up ahead.</i>

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:34.680
<i>Which means...</i>

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:36.160
Lady Ariane,

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:39.310
I will move forward and scout ahead a bit.

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:41.800
Dimension Move!

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:50.330
Ow, ow, ow...

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:56.400
It wasn't a bright idea to use that kind of magic 
when your line of sight is limited.

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:57.780
T-True.

00:16:57.780 --> 00:17:00.960
But it did pay off.

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:28.900
Thank you. Head back to Danka.

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:38.970
Danka and the girls we rescued 
are safely on their way to Lalatoya.

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:41.120
That's good to hear.

00:17:48.590 --> 00:17:49.710
Lady Ariane.

00:17:50.840 --> 00:17:53.840
Are we still a ways from Lalatoya?

00:17:54.770 --> 00:17:56.640
It's not that far.

00:17:56.640 --> 00:17:58.800
Another two nights and we should be there.

00:18:02.440 --> 00:18:04.610
Well, we covered a great distance today.

00:18:04.610 --> 00:18:06.830
One fish must not have been enough.

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:08.980
N-Now that you mention it, yes.

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:10.780
But I'll be fine.

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:14.840
Let's see if I can't hunt 
down a bull boar or two...

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:19.100
Th-Thank you.

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:46.760
I shouldn't wake her.

00:18:46.760 --> 00:18:48.920
Just... stay quiet.

00:19:01.730 --> 00:19:03.570
This should make a nice meal.

00:19:04.800 --> 00:19:07.120
Lady Ariane, I'm back—

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:08.460
Oh, Ponta!

00:19:08.770 --> 00:19:11.210
Who's a good girl?! Who's a good girl?!

00:19:15.010 --> 00:19:16.800
So fuzzy!

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:22.030
You smell wonderful!

00:19:22.440 --> 00:19:23.870
So adorable!

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:39.760
Oh, Arc. That was fast.

00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:44.150
My, that's a big bull boar.

00:19:44.150 --> 00:19:45.980
I suppose we should start cleaning it.

00:19:48.180 --> 00:19:51.620
Ponta, I'll be partaking 
of your fuzziness later as well.

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:58.210
Stop! Stop, stop, stop!

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:15.870
Princess, your tea is ready.

00:20:16.890 --> 00:20:18.370
Thank you, Ferna.

00:20:27.630 --> 00:20:29.310
Such a lovely aroma...

00:20:33.030 --> 00:20:34.610
Princess Yuriarna?

00:20:35.440 --> 00:20:36.990
Is something bothering you?

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:39.590
Well...

00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:45.960
I'm certain that Brother Dakares 
is involved in the elf trade.

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:49.600
And Brother Sekt won't stay 
quiet about it for long.

00:20:50.080 --> 00:20:51.170
True.

00:20:51.170 --> 00:20:53.650
Once Prince Dakares is cast down,

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:58.600
the throne will eventually 
be yours or Prince Sekt's.

00:20:58.600 --> 00:20:59.600
Ferna!

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:01.560
Princess?

00:21:03.180 --> 00:21:05.780
You shouldn't speak so carelessly.

00:21:06.660 --> 00:21:10.130
Right now, we must focus 
on the matter at hand.

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:14.250
The diplomatic mission to Limbult?

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:16.380
Precisely.

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:22.330
The Grand Duchy of Limbult is the only domain 
that has trade relations with the elves...

00:21:23.770 --> 00:21:27.360
We must arrange 
for a meeting with the elves

00:21:27.360 --> 00:21:30.140
and prevent any potential 
conflict from escalating.

00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:31.140
Right.

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:34.810
Still, it will be wonderful

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:39.600
to see your sister who married 
into the Limbult family after so long.

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:41.300
Yes...

00:21:41.300 --> 00:21:44.630
I wonder if Sister Seriarna is doing well?

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:50.430
We've nearly arrived.

00:21:50.430 --> 00:21:52.120
Once we pass through here...

00:21:58.280 --> 00:22:01.020
This is the elf settlement of Lalatoya.

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:44.980
Next Time

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:44.980
Learning About the Darkness of This World at the Elf Village

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:49.990
<b> I guess you can't just blow the fish out of the water with magic.
 #RiversideExcursion #HangingWithPonta</b>
